{"nodes": [{"id": "reference_images_local_playwright_new_local_rebuild_capture_1440", "label": "Local Rebuild - Full-Page Screenshot @1440px (v2)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "captured_at": null, "rationale": "Second iteration of the rebuild, captured at the canonical 1440px desktop viewport. Restores Events Coming Soon card, Application Steps Step 1/Step 2 cards with envelope icon, and the Prizes pixel-art icon cluster. Remaining drift: ticker still white background, RSVP pill black instead of white, 'Application Steps' heading rendered white on orange instead of dark, board and prizes backgrounds tinted pale mint instead of white, How-to-start-a-chapter band amber instead of yellow. Total height 7130px vs live 8396px, a 1266px shortfall indicating remaining missing vertical content. Dimensions 1440x7130."}, {"id": "discrepancy_rsvp_button_black", "label": "Discrepancy: RSVP Pill Black Instead of White (v2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v2 restored the Events card but styled the RSVP control as a solid black pill. The live site uses a white pill with dark text sitting on the light-blue card, creating a two-tone button pair. Reintroduces the same black-control error that v2 fixed in the header."}, {"id": "discrepancy_application_heading_white_text", "label": "Discrepancy: 'Application Steps' Heading White on Orange (v2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The block heading and the step-card labels render in white/light text on the orange field in v2, while the live site uses near-black. Low contrast against a saturated fill, and inconsistent with the near-black-on-light rule used everywhere else on the page."}, {"id": "discrepancy_board_background_mint_tint", "label": "Discrepancy: Board and Prizes Backgrounds Tinted Pale Mint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In v2 the Board section and the Prizes field sit on a pale mint-green wash. The live site keeps both on white / very light gray and reserves mint for the footer band only. The tint leaks the footer color up the page and flattens the section rhythm."}, {"id": "discrepancy_chapter_band_amber_vs_yellow", "label": "Discrepancy: Chapter Band Amber Instead of Pure Yellow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 'How to start a chapter?' band is a deeper amber/gold in v2 where the live site uses a bright pure yellow. Large full-bleed fields make hex drift highly visible, so this is a one-token fix with outsized visual payoff."}, {"id": "discrepancy_page_height_shortfall", "label": "Discrepancy: Local v2 Page 1266px Shorter Than Live", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At an identical 1440px width the local v2 full-page height is 7130px against the live 8396px - 15% of vertical content unaccounted for. Even after restoring the missing cards, the rebuild is materially shorter, which is quantitative evidence that sections or the pinned Board stage are still under-built. Height delta is the cheapest objective parity metric available from these captures."}, {"id": "discrepancy_board_sticky_not_reproduced", "label": "Discrepancy: Pinned Board Scroll Stage Not Reproduced in v2", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v2 at 1440px shows the three Board cards simply laid out in a row with no scroll-pinned stage, whereas the live desktop capture presents the Board as a tall region. Positionally the local build recovers the row layout, but the scroll behavior that the live section is built around is absent - which is also a plausible contributor to the height shortfall."}], "edges": [{"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_new_local_rebuild_capture_1440", "target": "announcement_ticker_band", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_new_local_rebuild_capture_1440", "target": "events_coming_soon_card", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_new_local_rebuild_capture_1440", "target": "application_steps_block", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_new_local_rebuild_capture_1440", "target": "board_sticky_scroll_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright_new.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_new_local_rebuild_capture_1440", "target": "prizes_awards_pixelart", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 